  "/us/shop/goto/watch/bands": { h1: "Apple Watch Bands", headings: ["Apple Watch Bands", "Color the moment.", "New Colors Sport Band", "Made to push boundaries.", "New Colors Sport Loop", "Stainless Steel", "Nike Sport Band", "Nike Sport Loop", "Only at Apple Solo Loop", "Only at Apple Braided Solo Loop", "FineWoven", "New Colors Hermès En Mer", "New Colors Hermès Scub’H Diving", "Hermès Grand H", "Hermès Faubourg Party", "New Hermès Néo Tricot", "New Hermès Toile H Double Jeu", "Hermès Toile H Single Tour", "New Colors Hermès Kilim Single Tour", "The ultimate way to watch your health.", "Personal beast.", "Walk it. Talk it. Track it. Love it.", "Footer", "footnotes", "Shop and Learn Shop and Learn +", "Apple Wallet Apple Wallet +", "Account Account +", "Entertainment Entertainment +", "Apple Store Apple Store +", "For Business For Business +", "For Education For Education +", "For Healthcare For Healthcare +", "For Government For Government +", "Apple Values Apple Values +", "About Apple About Apple +"], paragraphs: ["Explore the latest bands in fresh shades, styles, and materials.", "Custom high-performance fluoroelastomer with a pin‑and‑tuck closure.", "Four styles designed for Apple Watch Ultra 3. Bands uniquely tailored for the demanding needs of all workout types, outdoor adventures, and ocean sports.", "Soft, lightweight nylon weave with an easily adjustable hook-and-loop fastener. Dense loops on the skin side provide soft cushioning and breathability.", "Meticulously crafted steel designs for a sophisticated, upscale look.", "Compression-molded perforations for breathability. Color flakes make each band unique. A pin-and-tuck closure — carefully etched with the Run Swoosh logo — ensures a secure fit.", "Quick-fastening, flexible nylon weave with reflective yarn.° A woven pull tab featuring the Run Swoosh logo makes it easy to adjust on the go.", "Stretchable liquid silicone rubber designed for ultracomfort with no buckles or clasps. footnote *", "Stretchable yarn interwoven with silicone threads designed for ultracomfort with no buckles or clasps. footnote *", "With a distinctive pillow stripe, a subtle “H” motif, and a secure titanium buckle, this two-tone, water-resistant band is suitable for all kinds of aquatic adventures.", "Molded from high-performance rubber, this sporty and striking band is lightweight and water resistant with circular porthole-like cutouts.", "Adjustable stainless steel links are bookended by the iconic “H” motif. Available in the classic Grand H style and the slimmer, more refined Grand H Fin.", "This durable jacquard knit band features an illustration of Hermès’ iconic Faubourg Saint-Honoré store by artist Tibor Kárpáti.", "Inspired by Hermès sporting gloves from the 1930s, Néo Tricot is distinctively knitted in an openwork design that’s lightweight, breathable, and exceptionally comfortable.", "Silky and water resistant, this bold, contrasting band puts a graphic spin on Hermès’ emblematic checked canvas.", "A woven interpretation of Hermès’ signature checked canvas.", "Sporty with a splash of sophistication — Kilim is made from waterproof molded rubber with a deployment buckle.", "Shop Apple Watch Series 11", "Shop Apple Watch Ultra 3", "Bands are subject to availability.", "Compatible with Apple Watch SE and Apple Watch Series 4 or later.", "° Not intended for use as Personal Protective Equipment (PPE).", "* Band may increase in length over time.", "We approximate your location from your internet IP address by matching it to a geographic region or from the location entered during your previous visit to Apple.", "More ways to shop: Find an Apple Store or other retailer near you. Or call 1‑800‑MY‑APPLE ."] },
